sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Family browser
    participant N as Local Next.js through ingress
    participant A as Existing auth and policy
    participant Q as Exclusive local coordinator
    participant J as Local Jazz authority
    participant W as Opt-in pinned AI worker
    participant D as Local device and stdio child

    U->>N: POST conversation message with stable idempotency key
    N->>A: Verify session CSRF membership and engine consent
    A-->>N: Verified requester and allowed policy
    N->>Q: Admit scoped message intent
    Q->>J: Transaction message job event and receipt
    J-->>Q: Authority accepted commit
    Q-->>N: Durable receipt and cursor
    N-->>U: 202 accepted - not yet an assistant answer

    W->>N: Open workflow-only session pinned to conversation
    N->>A: Verify worker grant and sharing authorization
    N->>Q: Open session with hard expiry
    Q->>J: Persist session and idempotent receipt
    J-->>Q: Accepted
    N-->>W: Session and bounded call limits

    loop Only while the real worker continues and authorization is valid
        W->>N: Claim next family job with short wait
        N->>Q: Validate worker pin and claim operation
        Q->>J: Transaction lane claim fence and event
        J-->>Q: Authority accepted
        N-->>W: One claimed job and bounded authorized context
        W->>N: Heartbeat within hard session deadline

        opt A permitted device effect is required
            W->>N: Propose job capability and exact arguments
            N->>Q: Resolve requester delegation and effect identity
            opt Human approval required
                N-->>U: Display exact proposed action
                U->>N: Approve bound operation and argument hash
                N->>A: Verify non-model approver
                N->>Q: Persist single-use approval
            end
            Q->>J: Commit effect intent remoteCall and event
            J-->>D: Committed pending remoteCall
            D->>N: Private device claim
            N->>Q: Recheck fence grant cancellation and policy
            Q->>J: Accept device claim before execution
            N-->>D: Authorized claim
            D->>D: Execute one stdio tool operation
            D->>N: Report same operation result with fingerprint
            N->>Q: Persist or reconcile result without rerunning tool
            W->>N: Read bounded job tool result
            N-->>W: Result or explicit pending or indeterminate state
        end

        W->>N: Complete job with stable operation ID
        N->>Q: Validate current claim and effect ledger
        Q->>J: Transaction assistant message terminal state event and receipt
        J-->>Q: Authority accepted commit
        N-->>W: Completion receipt
        U->>N: Authorized SSE replay or bounded polling
        N-->>U: Committed reply and state
    end

    Note over W,Q: A 25-minute logical maximum is not a 25-minute HTTP request or liveness guarantee
    Note over Q,D: Unknown effects remain indeterminate - never blindly replay
    Note over U,N: If Mac is offline no new acceptance can be promised - hostname remains configured
